        PostgresPGVector[PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector :5432]
        LocalStorageVolume[Uploads Persistent Volume]
    end

    subgraph CloudFreeTier [Free Tier External Services]
        SupabaseDB[Supabase Managed PostgreSQL]
        GroqCloud[Groq AI Inference API]
    end

    ViteReact -->|HTTP / SPA Navigation| Nginx
    Nginx -->|/api/v1 Proxy| FastAPIApp
    FastAPIApp -->|Task Dispatch| RedisQueue
    RedisQueue -->|Job Execution| CeleryWorker
    FastAPIApp -->|Local DB Option| PostgresPGVector
    FastAPIApp -->|Cloud DB Option| SupabaseDB
    FastAPIApp -->|Local Storage| LocalStorageVolume
    CeleryWorker -->|Process & Chunk| LocalStorageVolume
    CeleryWorker -->|Vector Storage| PostgresPGVector
    FastAPIApp -->|LLM Inference| GroqCloud
